Intact.AI agentic DFIR skills

This subdirectory bundles a curated subset of SKILL.md files copied verbatim
from the upstream "Anthropic Cybersecurity Skills" repository (which has 754
skills total — see `MANIFEST.txt` for the list of skills bundled here):

    Project:   Anthropic Cybersecurity Skills
    Source:    https://github.com/mukul975/Anthropic-Cybersecurity-Skills
    License:   Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)
    Authors:   Mahipal and contributors

The skills are used at runtime by `services.agentic.skills.compose_system_prompt`
to inject domain-specific guidance into the analyzer's system prompt. They are
not modified — only the surrounding loader code in this project is original.

Per Apache-2.0 §4(c), the original copyright and attribution notices in each
SKILL.md file (frontmatter `author`, `license`) are preserved unchanged.

If you redistribute Intact.AI, retain this NOTICE alongside the LICENSE file.
